# Scoped registry for @jol-hub/* platform packages (ADR-011 Annex C).
#
# Spokes consume the hub packages as versioned registry dependencies pinned to
# ^1.0.0 — never as `file:`/path dependencies and never `workspace:*`. See
# docs/architecture/package-versioning-policy.md in jol-hub.
#
# GitHub Packages is published with `access: restricted`, so installs require a
# PAT with `read:packages`. The token MUST come from the environment; this file
# carries only the registry mapping and a variable reference, never a literal
# credential (INV-6 / secrets policy).
#
#   local:  export NPM_TOKEN=<pat-with-read:packages>
#   CI:     secrets.NPM_TOKEN
#
# Keep in sync with jol-hub/frontend/.npmrc, which carries the same mapping.

@jol-hub:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
